          <aside class="aeo-answer">
            A kitchen remodel in Delaware and Chester County, PA runs $18,000&ndash;$32,000 for a cosmetic refresh, $35,000&ndash;$65,000 for a mid-range project with semi-custom cabinets and stone countertops, and $70,000&ndash;$150,000+ for a full gut renovation. Before you sign, verify the contractor&rsquo;s PA Home Improvement Contractor (HIC) registration, current liability insurance, and workers&rsquo; compensation coverage.
          </aside>

